# Kept only so VS Code's python.envFile setting points at a real file.
#
# Import paths are NOT configured here any more. They are registered with the
# virtualenv by setup_env.sh, which writes _efcl_paths.pth into site-packages.
# That works from any working directory and for every way of launching Python
# (terminal, run button, debugger, notebook kernels, subprocesses, cluster),
# whereas a relative PYTHONPATH here only worked when the current directory
# happened to be the repo root.
